<% css_bundle :legal_information %>
<% provide :page_title, t("Privacy Policy") %>

<main class="mwenge-legal-policy">
  <header class="mwenge-legal-policy__header">
    <p class="mwenge-legal-policy__eyebrow"><%= t("Mwenge Catholic University") %></p>
    <h1><%= t("Privacy Policy") %></h1>
    <p><%= t("Last updated: [Month Day, Year]") %></p>
    <p class="mwenge-legal-policy__notice"><%= t("Draft template: replace every bracketed instruction with verified institutional information and obtain legal approval before publication.") %></p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2><%= t("1. About this policy") %></h2>
    <p><%= t("This policy describes how [institution or service owner] handles personal information when people use [name of learning platform and related services]. It applies to [covered users, services, and locations].") %></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2><%= t("2. Information handled") %></h2>
    <p><%= t("Describe the information collected or received, such as account and contact details, course participation, submissions, communications, device information, and service logs. Include information provided by students, educators, families, and administrators, where applicable.") %></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2><%= t("3. How information is used") %></h2>
    <p><%= t("Explain the institution's purposes for using information, including account administration, learning and teaching, support, service security, and any analytics or communications. Identify any additional purposes and the applicable legal basis.") %></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2><%= t("4. Sharing and service providers") %></h2>
    <p><%= t("Identify who may receive information, the circumstances for sharing it, and the service providers that process it. Explain safeguards, international transfers, and any disclosures required by law.") %></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2><%= t("5. Retention and security") %></h2>
    <p><%= t("Describe how long each category of information is kept, how deletion works, and the administrative and technical safeguards used to protect it. Provide a contact for reporting a suspected privacy or security incident.") %></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2><%= t("6. Choices and privacy requests") %></h2>
    <p><%= t("Explain the rights available to users and how to request access, correction, export, or deletion of information. Include any limits, identity checks, response times, and appeal process that apply.") %></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2><%= t("7. Children and student information") %></h2>
    <p><%= t("Describe the protections and notices that apply to children and student records, including the role of parents or guardians and any age-related requirements.") %></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2><%= t("8. Changes and contact") %></h2>
    <p><%= t("Explain how policy changes will be announced and when they take effect. For privacy questions or requests, contact [office or role] at [email address and mailing address].") %></p>
  </section>
</main>
